     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Step 1: Do the one’s place first.</p>\n<p>Borrow from the next column. Change 3 in the next column to 2.</p>\n<p>In base 10: (8 + 5) – 6 = 7</p>\n<p>In base 8: 7</p>\n<p>One’s place: 7</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{3}}\"></span><br>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Next step: Do the next place to the left.</p>\n<p>In base 10: 2 – 2 = 0</p>\n<p>In base 8: 0</p>\n<p>This column: Leave blank as it is the last column.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td><span data-math=\"\\cancel{{3}}\"></span><br>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>6</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>=</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><span data-math=\"{7_8}\"></span></p>"
    },
